      "title": "File:A View of Harar, Ethiopia (2144242835) (cropped).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5a/A_View_of_Harar%2C_Ethiopia_%282144242835%29_%28cropped%29.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:A_View_of_Harar,_Ethiopia_(2144242835)_(cropped).jpg",
